  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "阮兜ê兩隻狗"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張明敏</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮兜khah早有兩隻狗，一隻號做<i>Momo</i>，是公--ê，一隻號做<i>Apple</i>，是母--ê。<i>Momo</i> ke <i>Apple</i>九歲，兩隻狗仔lóng是阮小弟tshuā tńg來厝--ê。其實我khah少年ê時ē驚狗，因為pat tī路邊hōo狗咬，後尾我看著狗仔就ē緊閃；m̄-koh自<i>Momo</i>來阮兜規家伙仔做伴了後，我就發覺狗tsiok古錐--ê，真正是人ê好朋友。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Momo</i>是上代先來阮厝--ê，hit-tang-tsūn厝--裡lóng無細漢囡仔，<i>Momo</i> ná親像厝內ê寶貝，逐家惜命命。伊無愛行路、曝日頭，m̄-koh tsiânn愛出去tshit-thô，lóng buē眩車。動物醫生逐擺拄著伊就講tsit隻狗看--起-來真臭屁，叫伊「<i>Momo</i>少爺」。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊對阮阿母tsiânn死忠，tī厝內阿母行到佗位，伊就tè到佗位。阿母若是leh洗身軀，伊就phak tī洗身軀間門口等阿母出--來；阿母若出門，伊就坐tī大門口khuann-khuann仔等阿母tńg--來。我若假影伸手beh拍阿母，<i>Momo</i>就ē對我一直吠，是m̄是kánn-ná伊ê保鏢仝款？而且，見擺若聽著pùn-sò車ê音樂，伊就ē開始吠，提醒阮ài去piànn pùn-sò--ah！真貼心--neh。&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若講著<i>Apple</i>，伊mā是阮兜ê寶貝。13年前小弟tī夜市仔ê一个擔仔看著tann仔出世ê <i>Apple</i>，伊感覺tsit隻狗仔tsiok古錐--ê，想beh kā買tńg來kap <i>Momo</i>生囝。啥人知影<i>Apple</i> ê心臟自細漢就無好，五個月大就ài開心臟，好佳哉開刀了後就活跳跳--ah；m̄-koh，醫生huan咐講伊buē-tàng生--ah。Suà--落-來，兩隻狗仔就親像兄妹仔仝款，也是buē-bái--lah。<i>Apple</i> khah細隻，tsiok乖--ê，buē烏白咬--人；<i>Momo</i>就tsiânn歹死，koh ē kā厝內人咬。Iáu未嫁翁進前，我kap <i>Apple</i>可比是姊妹仔伴，有閒就鬥陣sńg，互相做伴buē孤單。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">飼狗進前，我聽過有人因為in兜ê狗死--去--ah，háu kah目屎流目屎滴，hit-tang-tsūn我感覺真hàm古，家己拄--著了後，就了解是按怎ē tsiah-nī悲傷直直háu ê原因--ah。<i>Momo</i> tī三冬外前過往--去，hit年ê年底阮囝就出世--ah，有時tsūn我ē leh想，阮囝kám是<i>Momo</i>來投胎？無，哪ē平仔tsiān--neh？Tuì阮囝出世，我就無法度tiānn-tiānn kap <i>Apple</i>做伴、tshuā伊出去sì-kuè tshit-thô，心內感覺真虧欠，想buē到<i>Apple</i> tī今年3--月suah雄雄心臟tiānn--去，mā離開--阮--ah。Tī tsia beh kā天頂ê <i>Momo</i> hām <i>Apple</i>講：「姊姊tsiok想--lín--ê，mā tsiok感謝lín ê陪伴，我永遠buē kā lín放buē記--得！」&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（作者是「樂講台語讀寫二班」ê學員）</span></div></div></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg9EFbcrQ0KiLgwa2M3eDFyBMb8onr0DzxmjrPbABstYbNb5WCsa5bTjFCfge6Y8sKaJuefDwv5G7LkeqJMDyJdbtmLLHD1XaPQwzWrLCwmYeW1vit5lAz4Tlw8bdA3FNykykQPQwZ0HeRZLmhobsG7mjMpOU6qVDcnHWa8jenw7OQMnDjY3mTVCo0SXA/s1424/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg9EFbcrQ0KiLgwa2M3eDFyBMb8onr0DzxmjrPbABstYbNb5WCsa5bTjFCfge6Y8sKaJuefDwv5G7LkeqJMDyJdbtmLLHD1XaPQwzWrLCwmYeW1vit5lAz4Tlw8bdA3FNykykQPQwZ0HeRZLmhobsG7mjMpOU6qVDcnHWa8jenw7OQMnDjY3mTVCo0SXA/w450-h640/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgoUQuMxYJySSzJ22XncvoUYqNm48CvyeT4E3h4n0u6wQxFKSwSNsQHDbEze-GoNhpmo-VqkoEDiM9kP8kDoi94RmStOk_j5LAPI1IJI8QG7ePIOVT3tWivuRXSa0sjHTbxj0ceXqutnFQ113tG7R5fJXaBAN9AncB6DyVXuTWkhLo4RGuFi4cvFHOjNA/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1344%E6%9C%9F_036_1.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgoUQuMxYJySSzJ22XncvoUYqNm48CvyeT4E3h4n0u6wQxFKSwSNsQHDbEze-GoNhpmo-VqkoEDi